  "notes": "Electricity bill, 2 pages, body-placed furniture. Page 1: letterhead (2 lines), recipient address block (body), two boxes SIDE BY SIDE ('Account summary' left, 'Your usage' right) as key/value tables read box by box; their titles are captions. The charges table is zebra-striped with a subtotal, VAT and total; the export credit is negative with a typed minus sign (U+2212). The usage history table is WIDE (13 columns: a label column and 12 months). Page 2 has a running header (one line), a meter readings table whose 'Type' cells have two lines, a CSS-drawn bullet list (no glyph) and a payment slip (dashed box) laid out as text beside a key/value table. Page numbers 'Page 1 of 2' / 'Page 2 of 2'."
